  GatedPrayersArray:
  - FirstToUnlock: 3
    Prayers: "Dude, whatever that purple stuff you're inhaling is, keep it up! I
      haven't felt so relaxed in months! @Waki\r\nI've heard legends of clouds, but
      never thought I'd see one! Yours are so massive and vibrant! @GazingUpToYou\r\nCloud
      watching is way cooler when you can see God making them in real time! @WeatherlyWeasel\r\nI
      thought it was too bright out and then you filled the sky with purple clouds!
      Thanks God! @ShadySeal\r\nThe clouds remind me of your divine wool! Blessed!
      @Fleecity \r\nPlease blow more of that purple stuff at the city! I cant get
      enough. I need it PLEASE PLEASE I NEED IT @RehabClinicServiceDesk\r\nYou're
      supplying the whole city with a years worth of hallucinogens  with each puff!
      Kind thanks! @3rdSozanGeneralHospital \r\nWhat flavor is that you\u2019re smoking?
      Either way it makes the city smell way nicer! Thank you Ram God! @Sniffer3000
      \r\nWhat are these objects on the table around us, my lord? Divine relics?
      @GazingGazelle"
  PrayerDataList:
  - Prayer: Dude, whatever that purple stuff you're inhaling is, keep it up! I haven't
      felt so relaxed in months!
    Author: Waki
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: I've heard legends of clouds, but never thought I'd see one! Yours are
      so massive and vibrant!
    Author: GazingUpToYou
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: Cloud watching is way cooler when you can see God making them in real
      time!
    Author: WeatherlyWeasel
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: I thought it was too bright out and then you filled the sky with purple
      clouds! Thanks God!
    Author: ShadySeal
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: The clouds remind me of your divine wool! Blessed!
    Author: 'Fleecity '
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: Please blow more of that purple stuff at the city! I cant get enough.
      I need it PLEASE PLEASE I NEED IT
    Author: RehabClinicServiceDesk
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: You're supplying the whole city with a years worth of hallucinogens 
      with each puff! Kind thanks!
    Author: '3rdSozanGeneralHospital '
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: "What flavor is that you\u2019re smoking? Either way it makes the city
      smell way nicer! Thank you Ram God!"
    Author: 'Sniffer3000 '
    SourcePrayer: {fileID: 11400000}
  - Prayer: What are these objects on the table around us, my lord? Divine relics?
    Author: GazingGazelle
